        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\n\r\nSHANAGHMOYLE, KNOCK, CO. MAYO\r\n\r\nOLD STONE 2 BEDROOM COTTAGE ON c.0.75 ACRE SITE\r\n\r\nFULL REFURBISHMENT PROJECT\r\n\r\nMartin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this traditional old stone cottage situated in a peaceful countryside location at Shanaghmoyle, Knock, Co. Mayo.\r\n\r\nLocated just 100 metres from the main N17 Galway–Sligo route and approximately two miles from Knock Village, this property offers an excellent opportunity to restore and create a charming countryside residence.\r\n\r\nThe property stands on a generous c.0.75 acre mature site and is positioned on a quiet cul-de-sac with only one neighbouring occupied residence, ensuring peace and privacy.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises:\r\n\r\n• Sitting Room\r\n• Living Room\r\n• Bedroom 1\r\n• Bedroom 2\r\n\r\nThe Property:\r\n\r\nThis traditional stone-built cottage requires complete refurbishment and renovation but offers excellent potential for restoration.\r\n\r\nThe property is eligible for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant of up to €70,000 together with the Derelict Property Top-Up Grant, subject to qualification and approval.\r\n\r\nThe Site:\r\n\r\nThe mature site is currently overgrown but provides ample space for restoration works, septic tank installation and landscaping.\r\n\r\nAlso located on the property are a number of old stone outbuildings which offer further restoration potential and may qualify for additional grant assistance subject to the relevant schemes and approvals.\r\n\r\nServices:\r\n\r\n• Public water mains available\r\n• Electricity passing the property\r\n• Telephone services available\r\n• Excellent road access\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n• Traditional stone cottage\r\n• c.0.75 acre site\r\n• Full refurbishment opportunity\r\n• Eligible for Vacant Property and Derelict Property Grants (subject to approval)\r\n• Additional stone outbuildings\r\n• Quiet cul-de-sac setting\r\n• Only one neighbouring occupied residence\r\n• Excellent accessibility to the N17\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Approx. 2 miles from Knock Village\r\n• Approx. 5 minutes from Knock Shrine\r\n• Approx. 10 minutes from Ireland West Airport Knock\r\n• Easy access to Claremorris, Ballyhaunis and Kiltimagh\r\n• Convenient to the N17 Galway–Sligo route\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents.\r\n\r\nMartin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioners\r\nMIPAV MMCEPI\r\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\r\n\r\n094 9362216 | 086 2130723\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided."
      }
